WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:03.336
NICK BUONICONTI:
<i> America has always stood</i>

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:06.806
<i> for being able to accomplish
 great things.</i>

00:00:08.307 --> 00:00:12.445
And I accomplished more than
my fair share of great things.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:15.548
♪ (SOFT PIANO MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.917
He was just competitive,
a ferocious fighter.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:20.520
<i> The guy just wouldn't give up.</i>

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.823
CRIS COLLINSWORTH:<i>  Nick's
 a pit bull with everybody.</i>

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:25.425
I thought
he just didn't like me.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:29.161
Football opened up every door
I could imagine,

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.564
<i> and then I got a phone call.</i>

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:35.268
That is a life changing moment.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.338
<i> He did feel a lot
 of responsibility</i>

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.239
<i> 'cause his son was following
 in his footsteps.</i>

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.576
MAN:<i> After Marc's injury,
 Nick let the world know</i>

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.913
that anything could be solved.
That was his life's mission.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.882
LYNN BUONICONTI:<i> I started
 noticing differences in Nick.</i>

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:52.652
He wouldn't remember
where he was that morning.

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:54.387
Everything is jumbled for me.

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:58.224
<i> People can see I'm not
 the person I used to be.</i>

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.427
He's had a remarkable life.

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:04.163
<i> He's changed things, you know?
 He's changed things.</i>

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.766
My legacy will not be
on the field.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.201
<i> It will be off the field.</i>

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.504
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

